    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectVisible? THEN\n\t\t\tDO MoveToLocationForObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tDO FindAndGrabObject\n\t\t\tDO CheckObjectProperties\n\t\t\tDO TakeObject\n\t\t\tDO SpecificTask\n\t\tEND\n\tEND\n"
